      "flags": 0,
      "text": "???: I’m coming up!"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main0010_rival_05",
      "hash": "53625afae0fb9ad2",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "Up and at ’em!"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main0010_rival_01",
      "hash": "536256fae0fb9406",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR RIVALNAME(0001)]: Morning, [VAR TRNAME(0000)]!"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main0010_rival_08",
      "hash": "53625ffae0fba351",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "What’s going on?\\nYou’ve got one weird look on your face!"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main0010_rival_02",
      "hash": "536255fae0fb9253",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "Aw, never mind that!\\nI couldn’t wait any longer, so I came to get you!\\c\\nToday’s finally the big day!\\c\\nWe’re finally going to get our first Pokémon\\nfrom Professor Oak and become real [VAR COLOR(0006)]Trainers[VAR COLOR(0000)]!"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main0010_rival_06",
      "hash": "536259fae0fb991f",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "Oh, but before we do..."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main0010_rival_07",
      "hash": "536258fae0fb976c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "You read the email I sent you yesterday, right?\\c\\nYou’d better have!\\nCheck your computer if you didn’t!"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main0010_rival_03",
      "hash": "536254fae0fb90a0",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "I’m gonna book it to Professor Oak’s lab,\\nso see you there!"
    }
  ],
